---
/** Speaking strip — ink section (§4.8). On-stage image [TOM TO SUPPLY]. */
---
<section class="bg-ink text-paper py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="container-tg grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow !text-powder mb-3">Speaking</p>
      <h2 class="mb-5">Book me to speak on AI-first marketing and performance.</h2>
      <p class="text-grey-400 max-w-md mb-8" style="color:#cbd5e1">
        Talks for founders, CMOs and event audiences on the AI-first marketing operation,
        honest measurement, and being the answer when your customer asks an AI.
      </p>
      <a href="/speaking" class="btn btn-powder !text-paper !border-powder hover:!text-ink">See speaking →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-powder-deep/30 to-ink border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center">
      <span class="display text-powder/60 text-sm">[TOM TO SUPPLY: on-stage image]</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
